                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 79/74.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-03"><hi rendition="#italic">January 3,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Launitz, chief police Petersburg, assassinated to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Meyer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
